  "description": "In partnership with Nouns GG, Oliyoun Auto Chess Club is on a mission to unify and engage the Dota Auto Chess community. Dota Auto Chess is a strategy game mod for Dota 2, developed by Drodo Studio and launched in January 2019. It features automated Dota 2 heroes battling on a chessboard layout. As of May 2019, the mod boasts over eight million players, and its popularity has spearheaded the auto battler genre.",
